---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Talents - Untamed</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character" class="active">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
					<span style="margin: 0 8px; color: var(--earth-brown);">·</span>
					<a href="/character/roster">View Your Hunters</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Talents</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Small passives and ability upgrades — earned every 5 Hunter Ranks</p>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="intro-section">
						<div class="info-box">
							<p><strong>Maximum 5 Talents.</strong> Choose 1 Talent every 5 Hunter Ranks. Talents are small passives or ability upgrades that shape your build without locking you into a playstyle.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Defensive -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🛡️</span> Defensive</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Brace for Impact</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/round</p>
								<p>When you take a hit dealing 8+ damage, reduce it by 2.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Second Wind</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/hunt</p>
								<p>When you drop below 25% HP, immediately recover Stamina equal to your CON modifier.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Stoic Recovery</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/hunt</p>
								<p>When you succeed a CON save vs ongoing effect (poison, burn, bleed), immediately recover 1d4 Stamina.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Offensive -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">⚔️</span> Offensive</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Momentum</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/round</p>
								<p>If you hit the same target twice in one turn, the second hit deals +1 damage.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Adrenaline Surge</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/hunt</p>
								<p>After you land a critical hit, your next attack this turn costs 0 Stamina.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Relentless</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/round</p>
								<p>After you break a part or Stagger a foe, gain +1 damage on your next hit this round.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Ranged & Precision -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🏹</span> Ranged & Precision</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Pinpoint Accuracy</h3>
								<p>Your Called Shots do not suffer disadvantage if you used a Preparation this turn (e.g., Steady Aim).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Quickdraw</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/hunt</p>
								<p>Your first ranged attack in this hunt has advantage.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Hunter's Mark</h3>
								<p class="frequency">Fast Action, 1/hunt</p>
								<p>Mark one visible monster: you gain +1 to hit it for the rest of the scene (ends if you go down).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Weak Spot Expert</h3>
								<p>When you hit a weak point, deal +2 damage.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Survival & Utility -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🌿</span> Survival & Utility</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Nature's Eye</h3>
								<p>When you enter a new sector, the GM reveals one hidden resource node or hazard without requiring a check.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Survivalist</h3>
								<p>Routine foraging/shelter in normal biomes requires no roll; in harsh/rare biomes, roll with advantage.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Sixth Sense</h3>
								<p class="frequency">Fast Action</p>
								<p>If you suspect hidden foes within 30 ft, make Sense (INS) with advantage to locate signs/angles (GM sets DC).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Trailblazer</h3>
								<p>Tracking wounded monsters: advantage and +5 ft movement while tracking.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Beast Whisperer</h3>
								<p>Animal Handling checks at advantage; on success, hostile beasts suffer -1 to attack vs you until your next turn (once/round).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Silent Step</h3>
								<p>You can move at full Speed while Stealthing without disadvantage.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Trapper's Instinct</h3>
								<p>When a creature is caught in your trap, its first escape check is at disadvantage.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Magic & Elemental -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🔮</span> Magic & Elemental</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Volatile Reaction</h3>
								<p>When you apply an elemental status (Burned, Chilled, Shocked) to a target already suffering a different elemental status, deal +1d4 bonus damage of the new element.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Burnout Focus</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/hunt</p>
								<p>When you drop to 0 Stamina, your next ability costs 0 Stamina (must be used by end of next turn).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Alchemical Knowledge</h3>
								<p>Crafting alchemical items: advantage on checks; when you use a potion, add +1 step to its effect (e.g., +1 die of healing or +1 turn of duration).</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Tactical & Team -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🎭</span> Tactical & Team</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Rally Cry</h3>
								<p class="frequency">Fast Action, 1/hunt</p>
								<p>All allies within 30 ft recover 1 Stamina.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Coordinated Strike</h3>
								<p>If an ally damaged your target since your last turn, your first hit against it this turn gains +1 damage.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Sacrificial Guard</h3>
								<p class="frequency">Reaction, 1/hunt</p>
								<p>When an adjacent ally is hit, become the target before damage is rolled; gain +1 AR vs that hit.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Crafting & Harvesting -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🦴</span> Crafting & Harvesting</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Efficient Harvester</h3>
								<p>On carve/harvest, gain +1 extra basic material.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Master Tinkerer</h3>
								<p>Traps/crafted gear cost 1 fewer common resource (min 1).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Keen Appraisal</h3>
								<p>You always know expected drops from the current monster (GM reveals the drop table tiers/flags).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Salvager</h3>
								<p>You can dismantle damaged gear to recover 25% of its base common materials (GM rounds).</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- Mobility & Evasion -->
					<section class="talent-category">
						<h2><span class="cat-icon">🐾</span> Mobility & Evasion</h2>
						<div class="talent-grid">
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Fleetfoot</h3>
								<p>+5 ft Speed.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Wall Runner</h3>
								<p>You can climb up to 10 ft of non-sheer surface each turn without a check.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Rolling Recovery</h3>
								<p class="frequency">1/round</p>
								<p>When you're knocked Prone, you may stand immediately (no cost).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Grappling Expert</h3>
								<p>Advantage on Grapple checks (initiate or resist).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="talent-card">
								<h3>Surefooted</h3>
								<p>Never suffer disadvantage on balance (Acrobatics) checks; advantage vs forced-prone terrain.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a;
				--forest-green: #2d5016;
				--moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a;
				--amber: #d4a257;
				--earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8;
				--text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}

			body {
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
				background: var(--forest-dark);
				color: var(--text-light);
				line-height: 1.6;
				min-height: 100vh;
			}

			.container {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 2rem;
			}

			.nav {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber);
				padding: 1rem 0;
				position: sticky;
				top: 0;
				z-index: 100;
			}

			.nav .container {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
			}

			.logo {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
				font-weight: 900;
				color: var(--amber);
				text-decoration: none;
				letter-spacing: 0.2rem;
			}

			.nav-links {
				display: flex;
				gap: 2rem;
			}

			.nav-links a {
				color: var(--cream);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: color 0.3s;
			}

			.nav-links a:hover,
			.nav-links a.active {
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			.breadcrumb {
				padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
			}

			.breadcrumb a {
				color: var(--leaf-green);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			.breadcrumb a:hover {
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			.page-header {
				padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown);
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
			}

			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 3rem;
				color: var(--amber);
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				color: var(--leaf-green);
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.content {
				padding-bottom: 4rem;
			}

			.intro-section {
				margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
			}

			.info-box {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown);
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
				font-size: 1.05rem;
			}

			.talent-category {
				margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
			}

			.talent-category h2 {
				color: var(--amber);
				font-size: 1.4rem;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
				padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown);
			}

			.cat-icon {
				margin-right: 0.5rem;
			}

			.talent-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
				gap: 0.75rem;
			}

			.talent-card {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border: 1px solid var(--earth-brown);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
				transition: border-color 0.2s;
			}

			.talent-card:hover {
				border-color: var(--moss-green);
			}

			.talent-card h3 {
				color: var(--cream);
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
			}

			.talent-card p {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: var(--text-light);
				opacity: 0.9;
			}

			.talent-card .frequency {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--moss-green);
				color: var(--cream);
				font-size: 0.7rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
				border-radius: 3px;
				margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.talent-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}

				.page-header h1 {
					font-size: 2rem;
				}

				.nav-links {
					gap: 1rem;
					font-size: 0.85rem;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
